    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests <b>data</b> about agent <b>id</b>. When <b>data</b> is available the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event will be raised</p>
  <p>Returns the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) for the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event when it is raised.</p>
</p>
